    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p>You Set a Spotlight on the target that does not move. The creature gains the diva role for the duration of the spell, in addition to their normally assigned role.</p><p>The diva can [[/act perform]] once per turn to restore 1d4 Hit Points to a creature in a spotlight. This has the healing trait and a trait associated with the performance, usually auditory for singing and move for dancing.</p><p>@UUID[Compendium.starfinder-field-test-for-pf2e.conditions.Item.WZTn5onQlTenBGi5]{Effect: Spotlight}</p><p>@UUID[Compendium.starfinder-field-test-for-pf2e.conditions.Item.vYCY3uEYojvomVFi]{Effect: Role}</p><hr><p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> The amount of healing increases by 1d4.</p>"
